  "Id": "92f3193e-a7dd-4417-b569-129823607fbe"/*PlotValueCurve*/,
  "Description": "Plots the recent history of a value as a curve with a label in the output.\n\nThis can be useful for debugging values in exported executables. While using the editor, [KeepFloatValues] or pinning a value operator to the output window might be more convenient.\n\nAKA: graph, plot, scope, oscilloscope, debug",
